    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/0324f1e5e12c29bc9b9efc6d19215690.avif?t=1752261882\" data-has-big width=800 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Blade is a skill-based vertical platformer with visuals influenced by Y2K era CGI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players &quot;Blade-Dash&quot; through blocks to reveal platforms and unique power-ups, managing their health and dash meters while ascending to the endpoints as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endpoints available at different heights with leaderboards to show off players times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can create a truly retro feeling experience by enabling post-processing in the video settings such as variable in-game resolutions, scanlines, screen distortion, subpixel size, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/0324f1e5e12c29bc9b9efc6d19215690.avif?t=1752261882\" data-has-big width=800 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Blade is a skill-based vertical platformer with visuals influenced by Y2K era CGI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/05dc2635977d24fb556a10cddc2ec722.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players &quot;Blade-Dash&quot; through blocks to reveal platforms and unique power-ups, managing their health and dash meters while ascending to the endpoints as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/560cd1ac142ce480a6574e1ac77469b3.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endpoints available at different heights with leaderboards to show off players times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can create a truly retro feeling experience by enabling post-processing in the video settings such as variable in-game resolutions, scanlines, screen distortion, subpixel size, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.poster.avif?t=1752261882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.webm?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743890/extras/5ceaa2aee80b09bf7399b38b9969db51.mp4?t=1752261882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
